      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Vrishchika (Scorpio) is water and fixed, owned by Mangal. Karka is water but movable (Chandra); Meena is water but dual (Guru).",
        "hi": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rashis.check.2",
