          },
          "body": {
            "en": "Surya owns Simha and Chandra owns Karka, side by side. Moving outward both ways: Budha owns Mithuna and Kanya, Shukra Vrishabha and Tula, Mangal Mesha and Vrishchika, Guru Meena and Dhanu, and Shani Makara and Kumbha.",
